e-24 and applicability-wording edits. Worktree fast-forwarded 4 commits to current main (no overlap with touched files) before editing. go vet ./... clean for tools/board-cli; task-board validate shows only pre-existing unrelated missing-spawn-log issues on other tasks. Patch attached as change-request_rev9.patch (base f9761007, candidate tree 18cac192, 5 changed paths); spec snapshot attached. Publishing fresh CR for independent review; not self-accepting.
