   263	deterministic encoding requirements of RFC 8949 Section 4.2.1. Their
   264	identity MUST be the SHA-256 digest of the RFC 8785 JSON Canonicalization
   265	Scheme (JCS) form of the logical object with its schema-defined self-identity
   266	field omitted. Those
   267	fields are <code>record_id</code>, <code>event_id</code>,
   268	<code>checkpoint_id</code>, <code>descriptor_id</code>,
   269	<code>manifest_id</code>, <code>plan_id</code>, <code>tombstone_id</code>, or
