   275	directory contracts. Each schema names exactly one self field; the namespaces
   276	are total and disjoint. Section 10.3 separately defines a
   277	<code>chunk_id</code> as the digest of raw chunk bytes; mutable journals and
   278	observation streams are not identity-addressed objects. A CBOR decoder MUST
   279	reject values outside the common logical data model and MUST produce the same
