   913	
   914	Terminal Backend Probe 1.0.0 is the following closed immutable observation; no
   915	other member is permitted:
   916	
   917	| Member | Exact type and constraint |
   918	| --- | --- |
   919	| <code>schema</code> | literal <code>urn:ax:schema:terminal-backend-probe</code> |
   920	| <code>schema_version</code> | literal <code>1.0.0</code> |
   921	| <code>probe_id</code> | digest computed by the identity rule below |
   922	| <code>terminal_backend_id</code> | terminal-backend-id |
   923	| <code>implementation_version</code> | semver equal to the admitted Manifest |
   924	| <code>protocol_version</code> | semver selected from the Manifest's <code>protocol_versions</code> |
   925	| <code>implementation_kind</code> | enum equal to the Manifest member |
   926	| <code>executable_digest</code> | digest|null exactly equal to the Manifest member |
   927	| <code>platform</code> | <code>macos|linux|wsl2|windows</code>, contained in the Manifest's <code>platforms</code> |
   928	| <code>os_version</code> | string[1..256] |
   929	| <code>availability</code> | <code>available|conditional|unavailable|unknown</code> |
   930	| <code>backend_generation_digest</code> | digest of the domain-separated raw generation |
   931	| <code>capability_claims</code> | sorted by capability, unique TerminalBackendCapabilityClaim[0..16] |
   932	| <code>evidence_ids</code> | sorted unique digest[0..256] referencing Capability Evidence 1.0.0 |
   933	| <code>probed_at</code> | timestamp |
