- The candidate includes an unrelated root `.DS_Store`.

The exact candidate’s tests, race tests, coverage, tracecheck, vet, build, formatting, and module verification pass—but only around the narrowed registry. Evidence and required rework are recorded in [TASK-260830-236x9n_review-verdict-rev2.md](/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-2wdm5e/worktree/.temp/TASK-260830-236x9n/TASK-260830-236x9n_review-verdict-rev2.md) and attached to the board with the review logs.
